WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.530
Inside the ring, around the dying star.

00:03.257 --> 00:08.647
Inside the ring we face the dying star: a white dwarf of about a hundred thousand degrees.

00:09.245 --> 00:14.584
Its dark knots, each wider than our Solar System, are real; where each sits is made up.
